; helper theory for arity-redeclaration-across-load-rejected.kurt. Auto-discovered and run
; on its own too, so it must check without an error. Declares a *different* arity for the same
; symbol name as arity-conflict-helper-a.kurt -- fine on its own, the point is what happens
; when both get loaded together.
arity P 2
prop P
use P $x $y implies P $x $y  "trivial-2"
